xcerpt":"Fried conch as someone else said! Also, good fresh seafood that doesn't cost a fortune. My food was really good, but my friend said his fish wasn't cooked well. My husband loved his food as well. I really like the staff. They are friendly and let us try things before we bought them. We ended up spending about $80 for the veritable mountain of food we bought, so the try it first policy worked well :) I'll definitely be back to get more of this not healthy at all but super tasty fried seafood :)"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"1prfnyowzCR5lQGWQNep-g","photo_id":"1YyzDp70u0DrB0qHvIuh_Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/1YyzDp70u0DrB0qHvIuh_Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9453624486923218},{"business_id":"1prfnyowzCR5lQGWQNep-g","photo_id":"2kIqu6QDiefjvYAsLKrSYA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/2kIqu6QDiefjvYAsLKrSYA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9282201528549194},{"business_id":"1prfnyowzCR5lQGWQNep-g","photo_id":"RL8CwYxIxLV88LODOWz0Mg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/RL8CwYxIxLV88LODOWz0Mg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8999475240707397}]},"notebook_case":null}
